    "description": "Retrieve full Markdown text and verified metadata for a specific case study by ID.\nWhen to use: Use when a client job requires deep proof of a particular past project, or when citing a case study referenced in search_evidence.\nWhen NOT to use: Do NOT use to search across all case studies (use search_evidence instead).",
