    "description": "List all technical and domain skills claimed across the persona's verified artifacts, with counts of how many evidence items back each skill.\nWhen to use: Use during the scouting and qualification phase to check if a persona possesses the must-have skills requested by a client.\nWhen NOT to use: Do NOT use to fetch detailed proof of a project (use get_case_study or search_evidence).",
    "inputSchema": {
